id: basic-attack
name: Basic Attack
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: true
requiresTarget: true
profile: any
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Attack with any Profile. Strike against the target's Dodge; on a win, Wound
  less their Soak Value.

# No printed entry here.
#
# What a Basic Attack does was given as rules rather than as its rulebook entry - the
# Profile sets the Ki Point Cost, the Strike Roll goes against a Dodge Roll, the Wound
# Roll less the Soak Value is the Damage. All of that is built, and the Profiles each
# carry their own entry word for word.
#
# So the row shows the description below instead. Paste the entry in as `text: >` and
# it will show that, with nothing else to change.

---
